Description: Description: Tools for quantifying Local Ecological Knowledge (LEK) 
    in landscape and ecosystem contexts. Implements quantitative ethnoecology 
    indices (Landscape Use Value, Cultural Importance in Ecology, Fidelity Level, 
    etc.) and provides Bayesian modeling and visualization tools for 
    participatory land-use decision analysis.
